# superpowers brainstorming visual-companion mockups -- session scratch, not shippable code
.superpowers/

# lavish-axi review artifacts (mockups, idea backlogs) -- session scratch, not shippable code
.lavish/

# Claude Code conversation exports (/export). Full session transcripts, dropped in the cwd
# with a date-prefixed name. Never belongs in a public repo -- they can carry anything that
# was on screen, and one is thousands of lines of noise in a diff.
20??-??-??-*.txt

# iCloud conflict copies. The repo moved OUT of ~/Documents on 2026-07-26, but the guard
# stays: iCloud silently creates byte-identical "<name> 2.<ext>" duplicates in a synced
# tree, and one got committed as a second paper-engine workflow that GitHub then ran on
# every schedule. See the CI guard in tests.yml and tests/test_repo_location.py --
# ignoring them is not enough alone, because `git add -f` and some tools bypass it.
# Extension-less duplicates (e.g. a symlink like ".venv 3") match the SAME iCloud pattern
# but not the original "* N.*" globs below, which require a literal extension -- ".venv 3"
# slipped past both this file and the CI regex while tracked in git (found during a repo
# layout cleanup pass).
* 2
* 3
* 2.*
* 3.*

# frontend (Vite/React) -- build output and deps, not source
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
